   761	def reservation_status(cfg, uuid):
   762	    """'absent', 'present (holder X)' -- a regular file holding a JSON object with a well-formed holder -- or
   763	    'present (...)' for anything else: a link (never followed), a non-regular file (a FIFO never blocks), malformed
   764	    bytes. ONE O_NOFOLLOW | O_NONBLOCK descriptor (Codex P2K-1 HIGH 3); Unreadable when it cannot be read."""
